  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing women, peace and security Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with UNSCR 1325, the focus is building women&#x2019;s capacities to engage in conflict prevention, mediation &amp; conflict transformation. They will create Regional Faith Women Mediation network at regional level with chapters in countries in the region.</narrative>
